      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can confidently state, \"As of now, we have seen no evidence of unauthorized access or data compromise,\" but only after your internal investigation has concluded and confirmed this finding. Give the reporter an opening to ask what happened if you suspect unauthorized access occurred (or if they are asking about the breach you mentioned), which could lead them to realize you already know the truth. You must still coordinate this statement with legal and PR to ensure it's factually accurate and doesn't inadvertently create new liability.",
